# Title: New Port Forwarding Rule Added Via Netsh.EXE
# ID: 322ed9ec-fcab-4f67-9a34-e7c6aef43614
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), omkar72, oscd.community, Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel
# Date: 2019-01-29
# Tags: attack.lateral-movement, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1090
# Description: Detects the execution of netsh commands that configure a new port forwarding (PortProxy) rule
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((Image="*\\netsh.exe") OR (OriginalFileName equals "netsh.exe")) AND (((CommandLine contains "interface" AND CommandLine contains "portproxy" AND CommandLine contains "add" AND CommandLine contains "v4tov4")) OR ((CommandLine contains "i " AND CommandLine contains "p " AND CommandLine contains "a " AND CommandLine contains "v ")) OR ((CommandLine contains "connectp" AND CommandLine contains "listena" AND CommandLine contains "c="))))
